---
/**
 * "Real-life example" — same bordered two-column card shape as
 * accounts-payable/RealLifeExample.astro, content swapped for the plant
 * maintenance example from the CFO Insights doc.
 */
const findings = [
  "Whether that spend was necessary",
  "Where it was concentrated",
  "What they could safely change",
];
---

<section class="bg-generic-00 py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:gap-8 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 flex-1">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h2 class="m-0 font-heading font-medium text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-h1)] leading-[length:var(--lh-h1)] tracking-[-0.5px]">
            Real-life example
          </h2>
          <p class="m-0 font-body text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-body-lg)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body-lg)]">
            Clarity AI identified $1.58M of optimisation potential in plant maintenance spend, worth ~$420K of EBITDA
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="h-px w-full bg-ledger-100"></div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <p class="m-0 font-body text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-body)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body)] max-w-88">
              Maintenance spend looked like a fixed cost of running the plants. The GL could tell the team how much they were spending.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <p class="m-0 font-body text-neutral-500 text-[length:var(--fs-body)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body)]">
                It couldn't tell them:
              </p>
              <ul class="list-none m-0 p-0 flex flex-col gap-2">
                {findings.map((f) => (
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="shrink-0 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-nova-blue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="font-body text-neutral-500 text-[length:var(--fs-body-sm)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body-sm)]">
                      {f}
                    </span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="m-0 font-body text-neutral-500 text-[length:var(--fs-body-sm)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body-sm)] max-w-87.5">
            Clarity AI connected maintenance spend with plant output, downtime and capacity, and separated what the business was actually buying at each plant.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative flex-1 min-h-75 lg:min-h-auto rounded-lg bg-visual-placeholder overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 left-4 sm:left-auto sm:w-83 bg-generic-00 rounded p-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
          <p class="m-0 font-body font-medium text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-body-sm)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body-sm)]">
            The result
          </p>
          <p class="m-0 font-body text-neutral-500 text-[length:var(--fs-body-sm)] leading-[length:var(--lh-body-sm)]">
            The analysis identified $1.58M of optimisation potential without trading off production capacity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
